{"id":"vod_hh_41865","vodId":"41865","provider":"hh","providerName":"豪华资源","type":2,"name":"境界触发者 第一季","name_cn":"境界触发者 第一季","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第73集","images":{"common":"https://hhmage.com/cover/4d1299920aba50082363b885093c8e6d.jpg"},"summary":"拥有28万人口的三门市，其境内某天突然打开了一扇通往未知世界的大门。从大门的另一端，被称为“近界民”的怪物蜂拥而出。人类惊慌失措之余发现，地球现有的武器对近界民完全没有任何效果。危急时刻，神秘团体境界防卫组织“BORDER”出现击退近界民，三门市总算回归往昔的正常生活。如是过了四年半的时间，隐藏着作为“BORDER”成员身份的初中学生三云修（梶裕贵 配音）和转学生空闲游真（村中知 配音）相遇，而对方竟然是来自门另一头的近界民，此行的目的是为了找到自己的父亲。分出不同阵营的二人，注定要在命运的战争中激烈碰撞……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-05-30 17:11:03","playable":true,"episodeCount":73,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"hhm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/YaOLzgRb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/1aKzv8Ge/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/RdGzoRKb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/9aAWg69d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Pdy7xw6a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Ddw2v0rb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/pen7jR5a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/nelXNxje/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/lej5NZyd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Ddw2vVXb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/YerBn8Le/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/mepBl8yb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/pen7jxpa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/nelXNx1e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Xe0EPYNa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/9b6G4XNd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第17集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/QeZvNYge/index.m3u8"},{"n